        "content": "[('np_zap',\n  'Zap a wand in the given cardinal (n, e, s, w) or ordinal direction (ne, se, sw, nw) or target yourself using self.'),\n ('np_pickup',\n  'Pickup things at your location or specify where you want to pickup an item.'),\n ('np_up',\n  'Go up a staircase at your location or specify the position of the staircase you want to use.'),\n ('np_down',\n  'Go down a staircase at your location or specify the position of the staircase you want to use.'),\n ('np_loot', 'Loot a box on the floor.'),\n ('np_offer', 'Offer a sacrifice to the gods.'),\n ('np_drop', 'Drop an item.'),\n ('np_read', 'Read a scroll, spellbook, or something else.'),\n ('np_put_on', 'Put on an accessory.'),\n ('np_remove', 'Remove an accessory (ring, amulet, or blindfold).'),\n ('np_takeoff', 'Take off one piece of armor.'),\n ('np_wield', 'Wield a weapon.'),\n ('np_wear', 'Wear a piece of armor.'),\n ('np_apply',\n  'Apply (use) a tool. If used on a wand, that wand will be broken, releasing its magic in the process.'),\n ('np_eat', 'Eat something from your inventory or straight from the ground.'),\n ('np_drink',\n  'Drink something from your inventory or straight from the ground.'),\n ('np_tip', 'Tip out the content of a container.'),\n ('np_dip', 'Dip an object into something.'),\n ('np_kick', 'Kick something.'),\n ('np_rest',\n  'Rests n-moves while doing nothing or until something happens (default=5).'),\n ('np_cast', 'Opens your spellbook to cast a spell.'),\n ('np_pay', 'Pay your shopping bill.'),\n ('np_pray', 'Pray to the gods for help.'),\n ('np_look', 'Look at what is under you.'),\n ('np_set_avoid_monster_flag',\n  'If set to true skills will try to avoid monsters.'),\n ('np_melee_attack',\n  'Pursues and attacks a given target using melee attacks until it is dead.'),\n ('np_explore_level',\n  'Explores the level to find new rooms, as well as hidden doors and corridors.'),\n ('np_move_to', 'Move to the specified position using pathfinding.'),\n ('np_go_to',\n  'Moves to the specified room or corridor using the shortest path possible.'),\n ('np_press_key',\n  'Presses the given letter. For special keys only ESC, SPACE, and ENTER are supported.'),\n ('np_type_text', 'Types the text by pressing the keys in order.'),\n ('search',\n  'Search adjacent tiles for hidden passages and traps. Pass `times` to repeat — hidden passages typically need 5-10 searches at the same tile to reveal. Defaults to 1.'),\n ('reveal',\n  'Reveal a rectangular region of the dungeon map as ASCII (for the bounding-box observation mode, where the map is otherwise hidden). Coordinates are map cells: x = column 0-78, y = row 0-20, inclusive. The FULL map (x1=0, y1=0, x2=78, y2=20) is a valid request and returns all 79 columns. Returns the sub-rectangle as text; consumes NO game turn. Out-of-range requests are clamped to the grid, and any clamping is stated in the reply.')]",
